Hi Robbie,

Sorry to bother you again. I am now still struggling with the imputation. Since our coverage is around 0.5X in the offspring, it seems not possible to use the alternative softwares you suggested as input data requires both alleles called in offspring for almost all of them. I am now thinking if I only want to impute those sites that are fixed for alternative allele between founders(Our AIL was founded by crossing 30 High body weight birds and 30 low body weight birds). Would specify K=2 make any sense, if I specify the input sites to be only those fixed markers.

Thanks again for helping.

Best,

Yanjun

